$ lets edit usage.ts --old 'const cap = 10' --new 'const cap = 20' --check no-such-checker
── usage.ts · 1 replacement · line 6 · check: structure ok · sha:c5525cc20b61→419c5d6249b3 · check: skipped (no-such-checker absent)

